<tool id="abricate_list" name="ABRicate List" version="1.4.0+galaxy0" profile="21.05">
  <description>List all available antibiotic resistance gene databases</description>
  <macros />
  <requirements>
    <requirement type="package" version="1.4.0">abricate</requirement>
  </requirements>
  <command detect_errors="exit_code">
        abricate --list &gt; '$output'
    </command>
  <inputs />
  <outputs>
    <data name="output" format="tabular" />
  </outputs>
  <tests>
    <test>
      <output name="output" ftype="tabular">
        <assert_contents>
          <has_line line="## Database Version: 1.4.0" />
          <has_n_lines n="100" />
        </assert_contents>
      </output>
    </test>
  </tests>
  <help>
**What it does**

ABRicate List will list all the antibiotic databases used by ABRicate. The database of these genes is built from ResFinder.
    </help>
  <citations>
    <citation type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btz086</citation>
    <citation type="bibtex">@misc{galaxy_toolsmith,
  title = {Galaxy Toolsmith},
  howpublished = {\url{https://github.com/BlankenbergLab/galaxy-toolsmith}},
  url = {https://github.com/BlankenbergLab/galaxy-toolsmith}
}</citation>
  </citations>
</tool>